The SVG files in this directory are from LobeHub Icons, npm package
@lobehub/icons-static-svg@1.95.1 (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons,
git commit 49a2130df7bfa5eb1b088261bff20a37e2967789), downloaded from
https://unpkg.com/@lobehub/icons-static-svg@1.95.1/icons/<name>.svg:

  anthropic.svg       <- claude-color.svg
  google.svg          <- gemini-color.svg
  amazon-bedrock.svg  <- bedrock-color.svg
  openai.svg          <- openai.svg
  openrouter.svg      <- openrouter.svg
  xai.svg             <- grok.svg

They are redistributed under the license reproduced below. The files were
sanitized (title, width, height and style attributes removed) and the
monochrome icons fill with currentColor.

